2. Use After Free (CWE-718): In the case of an error or unexpected condition, the function may free the response buffer using `free_rsp_buf(resp_buftype, rsp_iov.iov_base)`. If the same buffer is later used after being freed, it could result in undefined behavior (e.g., a crash, memory corruption, or arbitrary code execution).

