   return(GetFirstImageInList(image));
   ```
   The file is closed, and the decoded image is returned.

This function handles the complexities of reading a TGA file by parsing its header, reading different sections of the file, converting the raster data to pixel packets, and managing exceptions if something goes wrong during the process.

