The `command` variable is constructed by concatenating user-provided data (`credentials`) into the command string using string formatting (`'{} rclone lsjson current:'`.format(credentials)). An attacker could manipulate the `credentials` input to inject malicious commands, potentially allowing them to execute arbitrary system commands.

