Confidence Level: Medium-High (Potential for exploitation through unvalidated HTTP requests)

3. **Unprotected Storage of Session Data**: Although not explicitly stated, storing session data in memory (`self.last_alive`) may leave it vulnerable to theft or tampering by an attacker with access to process memory.

