   - CWE-89: High severity, high exploitability
   - Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) related risk: Low to medium severity, low to moderate exploitability
   - CWE-209: Medium to high severity, medium to high exploitability
   - Incorrect use of database transactions and unvalidated redirect: Low to medium severity, low exploitability

**Confidence Level:** Very High for CWE-89 (SQL Injection)

