- CWE-256: Unprotected Storage of Credentials - Low Confidence (possible vulnerability): Although not directly related to user input, storing chat IDs in plain text may pose some security risk, depending on how these IDs are used and stored. However, this would likely require more context to assess its severity accurately.
</analysis>

